  {
    "hotel_id": "148859",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/eurotel-makati-hotel/hotel/manila-ph.html",
    "name": "Eurotel Makati Hotel",
    "detail": "my stay there was okay. the location was good due to other venues being close by. the front desk staff were friendly and courteous, but, it depended on the shift i had to deal with and, the staff member or members. the bell hops were great, very courteous and helpful. breakfast was good and, the service was excellent. i stayed in a studio room and, it was okay. the wifi in the room was not too dependable. it kept going on and off and, if i wanted excellent uninteruppted wifi connection, i had to go down to the lobby. it would be nice if the hotel provided blankets for the guests. the beds only had bed sheets on them. if it got too cold, i had to either adjust the air conditioners temperature setting or, just turn it off. two pairs of slippers were provided but, the ones in my room had been used already and, one was broken on its side and, on both pairs, the front strap kept on coming out of its hole because it was kind of worn out. also, it would be nice if the plastic shower curtain would be cleaned better or replaced. the one in my room had mildew stains on one side and, it would also be nice if the rooms floor would be mopped and vacuumed or swept a lot better daily. if i wanted my room cleaned, i had to inform the front desk and give them my room key on a daily basis. otherwise, my stay there was very good and, i would definitely stay there again. the room rates were very reasonable and, the restaurant prices for food and beverages was also very reasonable. i would recommend eurotel makati hotel to friends and family traveling to the philippines and staying in the manila area.",
